{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づけば６月も終わりそうな時期になっていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はやいね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年は去年よりも時間があっという間に感じます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとすぐに蝉がミンミンと言い始めて、家に帰ったらアイスに手を伸ばしてるんだろうなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー2026"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一昨日、昨日の神奈川公演ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "福井県からはじまり、夏がやってきたのを実感する日々です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんに会いに行けるのも会いに来てくださるのも楽しみで嬉しくて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "熱く暑く楽しんでいきたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん汗かくぞ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年も最高の時間を一緒に過ごそうね^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は北海道！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まっててね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日はツインテールしてみた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勇気を出しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっぴり気恥ずかしかった…(笑)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもツインテール仲間がたくさんいたので、嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobgd9uam.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobzjtom8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "福井ではポニーテールしてたよ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobjfcTVk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうかな…？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "のんびり挑戦していきます〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次はなにがいいかなぁ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと悩んじゃう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな髪型がすき？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}